Subject: [PATCH v3] dt-binding: ipmi: add fallback to npcm845 compatible
Date:   Mon, 8 Aug 2022 10:54:52 +0300
Message-ID: <20220808075452.115907-1-tmaimon77@gmail.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.33.0
MIME-Version: 1.0
